<% content_for :meta_title, "Doug Morgen Services | Fractional CTO, Rails, Shopify, Automation" %>
<% content_for :meta_description, "Fractional CTO and consulting services from Doug Morgen: Rails applications, Shopify/e-commerce systems, internal tools, workflow automation, API integrations, dashboards, and data cleanup." %>

<section class="section-block">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">Services</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg text-slate-700">Doug Morgen provides fractional CTO leadership and hands-on implementation for founders and operators who need practical software they can depend on.</p>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="card">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Fractional / Half-time CTO</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">Part-time technical leadership for roadmap decisions, team execution, architecture, and delivery accountability without hiring a full-time CTO.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Rails Applications</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">New features, full apps, technical cleanup, and production support for Rails codebases that need momentum.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Shopify / E-commerce Systems</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">Order workflows, fulfillment tooling, customer operations, and integrations around your Shopify ecosystem.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Internal Tools + Automation</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">Replace fragile spreadsheets and repetitive manual tasks with clear internal software your team can actually use.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">API Integrations + Data Work</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">Connect systems, import and clean data, and build dashboards that support daily operations and decisions.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Accounting Migrations + Reconciliation</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">Migrate legacy ledgers into modern systems with strict idempotency, external ID controls, and penny-perfect double-entry validation.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card md:col-span-2">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Pragmatic Product + Execution Leadership</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">Roadmap prioritization, scope control, delivery cadence, and technical decision-making for founders and operators who need momentum now.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10">
      <%= link_to "Start a project", start_project_path, class: "btn-primary" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
